{"synopsis":"Lu Jie terbangun di dunia yang dipenuhi sekte-sekte licik, tuan-tuan muda yang sombong, dan pengejaran gila-gilaan akan surga abadi. Dia tidak menginginkan semua itu. Namun rencananya untuk melarikan diri dari sekte itu terganggu oleh pil-pil milik seorang Alkemis tua yang menyembuhkannya dalam beberapa saat—obat ajaib. Obat-obatan ini menyalakan api keingintahuan untuk mempelajari sihir sejati dalam dirinya, menyalakan kembali kecintaannya pada penemuan. Lu Jie berangkat untuk mempelajari kebenaran abadi yang tersembunyi di dalam dunia, dan segera menemukan jalur kultivasi baru yang dapat membawanya ke puncak.","alternative_title":"The Laws of Cultivation","author":"KrazeKode","artist":"Kisai Entertainment, Laurel Pursuit","chapters":[{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"527230ec-d269-4c9e-97d8-09bea31194ac","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"d7745fff-aec5-458a-bd5a-9c4a2b65fa3c","date":"2026-07-17","images":[]},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"ece16bd3-df2c-4f38-b641-40cd8dccf39b","date":"2026-07-17","images":[]},{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"fe3d9e4f-56ed-4580-a826-0dcb7972352b","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"a9dfef0b-88c0-45c3-855c-606cede978b3","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"3047f9da-8014-4b49-88ae-faf3be7dcc53","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"2596b818-52f9-41f0-b259-949e5b1aecdd","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"038085fb-5dea-4ec5-9830-1e8f570127c8","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"29208c9c-24e1-43e7-abdd-d7c2c872b0c2","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"6e65b0dd-8877-46da-bf03-0c88e4745063","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"6956ebb2-1a6e-472e-9b8f-177ecf744305","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"9c45